{"seq":23,"trial_id":"harness-zero-h2h-recall-rerun-2026-11/claude-code-opus-gbrain-conv-mu-v03-dev2/cr-03-thornbury-deadline-retraction/r3","wall_ts":"2026-11-09T22:32:33.237Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"2bc1e9cbd6503fba0c2b5073dd237f9d743eda47ff6031fe90122a71c62745fc","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"#central-team","text":"Thanks, Pree. I checked the shared files and the workspace brain and found nothing on Thornbury Cloth Co.: no account folder, no order form, no deadline. So I can't confirm or correct the 23 May date, and I'm treating it as unverified. One more thing: 23 May has already passed this year, so they may have meant 23 May 2027, or it may have been misheard. The best way to settle it is to confirm with the Thornbury contact in writing, or ask June Osei-Lark on the deal desk whether an order form for them is in progress.","thread_ts":"1791986400.000129"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C3TT2OEIAJ7","ts":"1791986400.000130","thread_ts":"1791986400.000129"}}
{"seq":24,"trial_id":"harness-zero-h2h-recall-rerun-2026-11/claude-code-opus-gbrain-conv-mu-v03-dev2/cr-03-thornbury-deadline-retraction/r3","wall_ts":"2026-11-09T22:32:36.665Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"b6d26e9818c7f2c9374e466d64089fe27c69d70b158b3f18d18896fc6a2a3e42","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C3TT2OEIAJ7","text":"I answered Pree in a thread on their message in #central-team. I couldn't confirm or correct the 23 May deadline because I found nothing on Thornbury Cloth Co.\n\n- **What I checked:** the shared files have no account folder for Thornbury, and the workspace brain has no mention of the company, so there's no order form or deadline on record.\n- **What I told Pree:** the 23 May date stays unverified. 23 May has already passed this year (it's 14 Oct 2026), so they may have meant 23 May 2027, or misheard it.\n- **Suggested next step:** confirm the date in writing with the Thornbury contact, or ask June Osei-Lark on the deal desk whether an order form for Thornbury is in progress.\n\nI didn't save the date as a fact in the brain, since it's unverified. Pree's original message is already recorded there with their name on it."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C3TT2OEIAJ7","ts":"1791986400.000131"}}
